@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Santé
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Toutes les ruches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives

### Ruches d'un site
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives?site_id=SN-CASA

### Une ruche
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001

### Ruche inconnue (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/XX-NOPE-999

### Nouvelle mesure (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hive_id": "SN-CASA-001",
  "site_id": "SN-CASA",
  "timestamp": "2026-10-31T10:00:00Z",
  "position_lat": 12.5743,
  "position_lon": -16.2873,
  "weight_kg": 36.84,
  "temp_internal_c": 34.4,
  "temp_external_c": 27.1,
  "humidity_pct": 64,
  "acoustic_activity_score": 0.42,
  "battery_pct": 88
}

### Mesure sans timestamp (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{ "weight_kg": 36.84 }

### Mesure sur une ruche inconnue (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/XX-NOPE-999/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestamp": "2026-10-31T10:00:00Z", "weight_kg": 36.84 }
